#: ../../source/verror_README.md:3
msgid ""
"This module provides several classes in support of Joyent's [Best "
"Practices for Error Handling in "
"Node.js](http://www.joyent.com/developers/node/design/errors). If you "
"find any of the behavior here confusing or surprising, check out that "
"document first."
msgstr ""

