msgid ""
"It's not expected that you'd use these complex forms all the time.  "
"Despite supporting the complex case above, you can still just do:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/verror_README.md:205
msgid "new VError(\"my service isn't working\");"
msgstr ""

