#: ../../source/verror_README.md:210
msgid "Reference: VError, WError, SError"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/verror_README.md:212
msgid ""
"VError, WError, and SError are convenient drop-in replacements for "
"`Error` that support printf-style arguments, first-class causes, "
"informational properties, and other useful features."
msgstr ""

